Are you crazy?! I'm the one who barged into this time-line!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.930
I'll leave!

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:25.000
I will!
I'll leave!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.040
I will!
I will!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.790
Time-slipping isn't easy to do, y'know!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.820
You know, we could get stranded in
some strange place and time!

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:46.250
Th...That's right! I could end up
kissing the world I know good-bye...

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:48.590
You don't want that, do you?

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:49.620
No...
You don't want that, do you?

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:49.710
You don't want that, do you?

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:52.990
So that's that. I'll leave! Farewell!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.100
Aren't you gonna stop me?

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:03.470
Huh? Oh, th...that's right!
Aren't you gonna stop me?

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:03.560
Aren't you gonna stop me?

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:04.710
Don't! Don't go!

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:06.970
I've changed my mind! You go!
Don't! Don't go!

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:07.060
Don't! Don't go!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:09.570
What're you doing?!
Stop it! I don't wanna go!

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:12.610
Idiot! I don't wanna go either!

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.590
Ushiko, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:41.040
Wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.630
"Speed Up!"

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.450
Ushiko!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:46.420
Umao!
Ushiko!

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.630
Kyosuke... Kyosuke?!

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:09.480
I'm alone... That means...

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:11.510
It all went like I wanted it to?!

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:22.450
Kasuga Kyosuke, Happy Birthday!

00:22:26.690 --> 00:22:31.390
In the end, I was somehow able to
remain in this time-line...

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:36.450
Thank goodness, at any rate...

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.110
...no one got hurt along the way.

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:41.240
Neither Ayukawa nor Hikaru found out about...

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:44.000
...the family secret.

00:22:46.480 --> 00:22:48.440
Magic time!

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:51.950
Like that?

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:52.950
You idiot!
Like that?

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:53.710
Ow!
You idiot!

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.670
Falling down those steps twice was certainly painful, no doubt...

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:00.200
...but it was nothing, really.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:03.610
Besides... Nobody ended up
getting hurt after all.

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:05.790
Neither Hikaru nor Ayukawa...

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:09.660
I'm sorry, but we're booked for the ev...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.560
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:44.820
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:49.150
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:53.390
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.390 --> 00:24:01.260
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.260 --> 00:24:10.770
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:18.580
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:27.250
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.250 --> 00:24:36.960
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:45.340
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.340 --> 00:24:49.680
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:54.010
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.010 --> 00:24:58.320
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.320 --> 00:25:02.660
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:07.480
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.890 --> 00:25:14.130
The Truth Mushroom...

00:25:14.130 --> 00:25:17.830
Eating one makes you
tell the truth about everything!

00:25:17.830 --> 00:25:22.810
I want Ayukawa to eat it, as soon as I can find one!

00:25:22.810 --> 00:25:25.320
Is it perverted of me, I wonder, to think that way?

00:25:25.320 --> 00:25:29.900
Next time: "Mystical Madoka!
The Mushrooms of 120% Truthfulness."
